Record 27,000-Room Quarter Lifts Q3 RevPAR 5.8%","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5UcWVXNmtMZC1waEZ0VlJMRVhkRGFtR2JadlJCSGpSZTJtSE1xMmVpeGxxd1FjLWVSbDlPNXFjOTNodVJSZVhpRW1yTGRsWUM0dmZ0WDh2eVNjUGhN?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"[希爾頓全球控股 2026 年第 3 季財報電話會議] 希爾頓將全年 RevPAR 指引上調至 4%-4.5%，創紀錄的 27,000 間客房季度將第 3 季的 RevPAR 提高了 5.8%"},{"title":"Hilton shares drop as investors weigh results, full-year outlook","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPZEgxOEd1Z3R1dmtQUnFwc1pva0xwTmNsYVZwLVg2eVdpX3pvTmZMc0tzME9vNk9hUVc0bDNxa2Y1N1VjYWxWLUhRZm5XelZCcnpMQzlWOERHdE5HbTI0V3lCNDRYZEltd0VGTEw1VkJqVW53V2ZZWVRfQnc5RTA1Umd3RTJhUTJLUkxKcmkwVVMybU5QNGlUTDdtdnIyenlTS3R3bmUxUVNBMy1CTmFyR2pPOXZUcEV2TTJkRmVPd240dFVs?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"投資者權衡業績和全年前景，希爾頓股價下跌"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1585689/000158568926000007/hlt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Hilton is one of the largest global hospitality companies, with 9,158 properties comprising 1,351,351 rooms in 143 countries and territories as of December 31, 2025. Founded in 1919, Hilton has been an innovator in the industry for over 105 years, driven by the vision of founder Conrad Hilton \"to fill the earth with the light and warmth of hospitality.\" Our premier brand portfolio includes luxury, lifestyle, full service, focused service and all-suites hotel brands, as well as timeshare brands. As of December 31, 2025, we had 243 million members in our award-winning guest loyalty program, Hilton Honors, an increase of 15 percent from December 31, 2024; refer to \"—Our Brand Portfolio\" and \"—Our Guest Loyalty Program\" below for additional information on our brands, including Hilton Honors.","zh":"希爾頓是全球最大的酒店公司之一，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，在 143 個國家和地區擁有 9,158 家酒店，包括 1,351,351 間客房。希爾頓成立於 1919 年，105 年來一直是該行業的創新者，其創始人康拉德·希爾頓 (Conrad Hilton) 的願景是「讓地球充滿熱情好客的光芒和溫暖」。我們的頂級品牌組合包括豪華、生活方式、全方位服務、專注服務和全套房酒店品牌，以及分時度假品牌。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們屢獲殊榮的賓客忠誠度計劃希爾頓榮譽客會 (Hilton Honors) 擁有 2.43 億會員，較 2024 年 12 月 31 日增加了 15%；請參閱下面的“—我們的品牌組合”和“——我們的榮譽客"},{"en":"We operate our business through: (i) a management and franchise segment and (ii) an ownership segment, each of which is reported as a segment based on (a) delivering a similar set of products and services and (b) being managed separately given its distinct economic characteristics. The management and franchise segment includes all of the hotels we manage for third-party owners, as well as all properties that license our intellectual property (\"IP\") and/or use our booking channels and related programs, and where we provide other contracted services, but the day-to-day services of the hotels are operated or managed by someone other than us. Revenues from this segment include: (i) management and franchise fees charged to third-party hotel owners; (ii) licensing fees from our strategic partners, including co-branded credit card providers and strategic partner hotels, and Hilton Grand Vacatio","zh":"我們透過：（i）管理和特許經營部門以及（ii）所有權部門經營我們的業務，每個部門都作為一個部門報告，基於（a）提供類似的產品和服務，以及（b）鑑於其獨特的經濟特徵進行單獨管理。管理和特許經營部門包括我們為第三方所有者管理的所有飯店，以及授權我們的智慧財產權（「IP」）和/或使用我們的預訂管道和相關程序的所有飯店，以及我們提供其他合約服務的飯店，但飯店的日常服務由我們以外的其他人經營或管理。該分部的收入包括：(i) 向第三方酒店業主收取的管理費和特許經營費； (ii) 來自我們的戰略合作夥伴的許可費，包括聯合品牌信用卡提供商和戰略合作夥伴酒店以及希爾頓度假大酒店"},{"en":"In addition to our current hotel portfolio, we are focused on the growth of our business by expanding our global hotel network through our development pipeline, which represents hotels that we expect to add to our system in the future. The following table summarizes our development activity:","zh":"除了我們目前的酒店組合外，我們還透過我們的開發管道擴大我們的全球酒店網路，從而專注於我們的業務成長，這代表了我們希望在未來添加到我們系統中的酒店。下表總結了我們的開發活動："}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We encounter active and robust competition as a hotel and resort manager, franchisor and lessee. Competition in the hospitality industry is based on several criteria, generally including: the attractiveness of the facility; location; level of service; quality of accommodations; amenities; food and beverage options and outlets; public and meeting spaces and other guest services; consistency of service; room rate; brand reputation; and the ability to earn and redeem loyalty program points through a global system. Our properties and brands compete with other hotels, resorts, motels, inns and other accommodation rental services in their respective geographic markets or customer segments, including facilities owned by local interests, individuals, national and international chains, institutions, investment and pension funds and real estate investment trusts (\"REITs\"). We believe that our capa","zh":"作為酒店和度假村的管理者、特許經營者和承租人，我們面臨著積極而激烈的競爭。旅館業的競爭基於幾個標準，通常包括： 設施的吸引力；地點;服務水準；住宿品質；便利設施；食品和飲料選擇和銷售點；公共和會議空間以及其他賓客服務；服務的一致性；房費；品牌聲譽；以及透過全球系統賺取和兌換忠誠度計劃積分的能力。 Our properties and brands compete with other hotels, resorts, motels and brands compete with other hotels, resorts, motels, inns and other accommodation rental services in their respective geographic markets or customer segments, including facilities owned by locals insd and invidence and ins​​om andion andion and ins​​ion and insion and insion and insari and insari and insative and ins​​st andie and ined andie and andie and g正確ed ined 和錯誤 和 ins負ation insariation and insarient and ins​​st andie and ins and andie and and顏色 and alariative and alindis insarient and ins​​st andie and ins and andie and and顏色 and alindi al and顏色 and alindi and顏色 and al結論 and alindis anded ined and anded and錯誤, in錯誤相同 和 ins每天, insindi and ins溫度, ins​​om pension funds and real estate investment trusts (\"REITs\").我們相信我們的能力"},{"en":"Our principal competitors include other branded and independent hotel operating companies, national and international hotel brands and ownership companies. While local and independent brand competitors vary, on a global scale, our primary competitors are Accor S.A., Choice Hotels International, Hyatt Hotels Corporation, Intercontinental Hotel Group, Marriott International and Wyndham Hotels & Resorts.","zh":"我們的主要競爭對手包括其他品牌和獨立酒店營運公司、國內和國際酒店品牌和所有權公司。雖然本地和獨立品牌的競爭對手各不相同，但在全球範圍內，我們的主要競爭對手是雅高酒店集團、精品國際酒店集團、凱悅酒店集團、洲際酒店集團、萬豪國際集團和溫德姆酒店及度假村。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Managementand Franchise","val":3575000000,"zh":"管理與特許經營"},{"name":"Ownership","val":1233000000,"zh":"所有權"}],"total":12039000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Reimbursement Revenue","val":7085000000,"zh":"報銷收入"},{"name":"Totalrevenuesexcludingreimbursablerevenues","val":4954000000,"zh":"總收入不包括可償還收入"},{"name":"Franchiseandlicensingfees","val":2780000000,"zh":"特許經營和許可費"},{"name":"Ownership","val":1233000000,"zh":"所有權"},{"name":"Management Service Base","val":376000000,"zh":"管理服務基地"},{"name":"Management Service Incentive","val":313000000,"zh":"管理服務獎勵"},{"name":"Hotel Other","val":252000000,"zh":"飯店其他"}],"total":12039000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":9523000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2516000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":12039000000}},"peers":["MAR","H","UAL","EXPE","RCL"]}}